    "description": "Hydrologic Basins\n\nThis dataset defines the areal extnet of surface water drainage to a point. The selection and delineation of hydrologic boundaries are determined solely upon science-based hydrologic principles, not favoring any administration, special project, program, or agency.\n\nSource: USGS National Hydrography Dataset",
